1
00:00:37,154 --> 00:00:38,029
蝠鲼5-1
Manta 5-1.

2
00:00:39,529 --> 00:00:40,696
欢迎回家
Welcome home.

3
00:00:42,696 --> 00:00:43,904
请继续前往擎天空港的
Please continue your approach

4
00:00:43,988 --> 00:00:45,738
欧米伽-12停机坪
to Atlas docking bay, Omega-12.

5
00:00:46,446 --> 00:00:47,946
一支安保小组将在那里等你们
A security team will meet you there.

6
00:00:48,363 --> 00:00:48,696
完毕
Over.

7
00:00:48,946 --> 00:00:51,571
我不明白 这里发生了什么?
I don't understand. What's happening here?

8
00:00:51,904 --> 00:00:53,029
我不知道
I don't know.

9
00:00:53,738 --> 00:00:56,738
但是我们已经到了这里 把提灯带到了擎天
But we are here. We got the lamp to Atlas.

10
00:00:56,821 --> 00:00:59,904
所以我觉得我们应该先着陆 然后就会有答案
So, I guess we land and get some answers.

11
00:01:00,321 --> 00:01:01,696
我不太确定
I'm not so sure.

12
00:01:04,238 --> 00:01:07,404
我从来没有见过军队部署得如此激进
I've never seen our forces deployed so aggressively before.

13
00:01:08,363 --> 00:01:09,946
如果我们用偷来的船着陆
If we land in a stolen ship,

14
00:01:10,113 --> 00:01:13,113
安保小组绝不会让我们接近埃隆伍德将军
there's no way the security team will let us anywhere near Ironwood.

15
00:01:14,571 --> 00:01:16,529
他们甚至会把我带回我父亲身边
They might even take me back to my father.

16
00:01:19,654 --> 00:01:20,529
那.
So...

17
00:01:21,363 --> 00:01:21,821
温特!
Winter!

18
00:01:23,279 --> 00:01:24,988
保持住与舰队之间的距离
Put some distance between us and the fleet.

19
00:01:25,363 --> 00:01:26,863
你不说我也会保持距离的
You don't have to tell me twice.

20
00:01:49,904 --> 00:01:52,029
...我们的感激无以言表...
[Braodcast] ...cannot express our appreciation enough....

21
00:01:53,696 --> 00:01:55,863
许多人认为现在是个动荡的时代
Many describe these as uncertain times,

22
00:01:56,279 --> 00:01:58,363
尽管世界的其他地区也许正阴云密布
and while that may be the case for the rest of the world,

23
00:01:58,863 --> 00:02:00,488
但我可以确定的是
I can tell you what is certain.

24
00:02:01,029 --> 00:02:05,988
擎天王国依然强大且安定
The Kingdom of Atlas will remain strong, and it will remain safe.

25
00:02:06,696 --> 00:02:08,863
这就是我的承诺
That is my promise.

26
00:02:11,029 --> 00:02:12,196
埃隆伍德将军
General Ironwood.

27
00:02:12,779 --> 00:02:13,779
他看起来
He looks...

28
00:02:14,363 --> 00:02:15,113
很累
Tired.

29
00:02:15,863 --> 00:02:18,529
詹姆斯 你都做了些什么?
James, what have you been doing?

30
00:02:19,529 --> 00:02:21,446
唉 怎么又是这些东西
[Civilian 1] Ugh, not these again.

31
00:02:21,488 --> 00:02:23,196
为什么就不能放过我们呢?
[Civilian 2] Why can't they just leave us be?

32
00:02:29,321 --> 00:02:30,321
情况不正常
This isn't right.

33
00:02:30,946 --> 00:02:31,946
这里都不正常
None of this is right.

34
00:02:32,113 --> 00:02:34,446
蝠鲼5-1 我们发现你已偏航
[Radio] Manta 5-1, we've noticed a detour in your route.

35
00:02:34,821 --> 00:02:37,654
请你立即前往欧米伽-12停机坪
You are to make your way to docking bay Omega-12 immediately,

36
00:02:37,988 --> 00:02:38,904
听见了吗
do you copy?

37
00:02:39,029 --> 00:02:39,571
完毕
Over.

38
00:02:39,779 --> 00:02:42,113
孩子们 我们快要没时间了
We're kind of running out of time here, kids.

39
00:02:42,404 --> 00:02:43,529
我们得弃船了
We need to ditch the ship.

40
00:02:43,779 --> 00:02:44,446
好主意
Agreed.

41
00:02:44,779 --> 00:02:46,821
在曼特城里迷迷路 还能争取点时间
Get lost in Mantle and buy ourselves some time.

42
00:02:47,113 --> 00:02:49,571
我说过了 我姐姐能带我们去见埃隆伍德
I'm telling you, my sister can take us to Ironwood.

43
00:02:50,279 --> 00:02:51,988
呃 Weiss?
Uh, Weiss?

44
00:02:55,821 --> 00:02:56,654
这是一则提醒
[Broadcast] A reminder.

45
00:02:57,488 --> 00:02:58,154
嗯?
Huh?

46
00:02:58,738 --> 00:03:01,529
不与擎天军队合作
to cooperate with Atlas military per

47
00:03:01,654 --> 00:03:03,113
将会受到严惩
punishable offe

48
00:03:03,738 --> 00:03:05,404
如果你所在的区域被封锁.
If your sector is under lockdown...

49
00:03:04,363 --> 00:03:05,196
温特?
Winter?

50
00:03:05,904 --> 00:03:07,321
Weiss 无意冒犯
No offense, Weiss.

51
00:03:07,988 --> 00:03:09,988
我不再觉得这是个好主意了
I'm not sure that's a good idea anymore.

52
00:03:10,488 --> 00:03:12,654
这里的情况显然很不正常
There's obviously something very wrong.

53
00:03:12,946 --> 00:03:14,404
如果我们能和她说明情况 那我们...
If we can just talk to her, then we--

54
00:03:14,446 --> 00:03:17,196
听着在彻底弄清楚曼特城的现状之前
Look, I'm not even sure we should be talking to Ironwood

55
00:03:17,321 --> 00:03:19,571
我都对与埃隆伍德的谈话持保留意见
until we know exactly what's going on with Mantle.

56
00:03:19,654 --> 00:03:19,904
但是...
But--

57
00:03:19,988 --> 00:03:21,571
所有人都冷静一下
Everyone, calm down.

58
00:03:22,988 --> 00:03:24,821
我认识一个可以帮上忙的人
(sighs) I know someone who can help with both.

59
00:03:25,238 --> 00:03:27,404
蝠鲼5-1 请你马上..
[Radio] Manta 5-1, you are to make your-

60
00:03:27,488 --> 00:03:29,613
这位女士 读读空气
Jeez, lady, take a hint.

61
00:03:45,904 --> 00:03:47,613
它在那边着陆了快走
It landed over there, let's go!

62
00:04:01,988 --> 00:04:03,321
来 快跟上
Come on now, hurry!

63
00:04:03,613 --> 00:04:04,904
走路应该不远
It shouldn't be much of a walk.

64
00:04:06,321 --> 00:04:08,779
街上有这么多士兵正常吗
Is this many soldiers normal?

65
00:04:09,279 --> 00:04:09,863
不正常
No.

66
00:04:10,446 --> 00:04:12,779
至少我觉得不正常
At least, I didn't think so.

67
00:04:13,279 --> 00:04:13,821
啊?
Huh?

68
00:04:29,113 --> 00:04:29,779
噫
Ooh.

69
00:04:31,196 --> 00:04:32,571
我们可能得走快些了
Maybe we should pick up the pace.

70
00:04:34,113 --> 00:04:35,154
你们要知道
You have to remember,

71
00:04:35,446 --> 00:04:37,529
王国刚在大战中败北
the kingdom had just lost the Great War.

72
00:04:37,946 --> 00:04:40,696
曼特的人民想看到光明未来的希望
The people of Mantle needed a sign of a brighter future,

73
00:04:40,821 --> 00:04:42,446
而这个希望就是擎天
and that sign was Atlas.

74
00:04:42,779 --> 00:04:45,154
毕竟 一个在云端的家
After all, a home in the clouds

75
00:04:45,279 --> 00:04:46,988
就如未来一般明亮
is about as bright as it gets.

76
00:04:55,946 --> 00:04:57,821
除非你是那个不得不抬头看它的人
Unless you're the one having to look up at it.

77
00:04:58,279 --> 00:05:01,154
整座城市看起来都太糟了
This whole city, it just seems awful.

78
00:05:01,446 --> 00:05:02,238
是吗?
Yeah?

79
00:05:03,404 --> 00:05:04,613
你不喜欢这里是吗?
You don't like it here?

80
00:05:05,279 --> 00:05:08,071
外边的苔原上有大把的空地
There's plenty of space out in the tundra.

81
00:05:09,363 --> 00:05:10,654
对不起 我没想....
Sorry, I didn't mean to-

82
00:05:10,779 --> 00:05:13,696
擎天是世界上最强大的国家 好吗
Atlas is the greatest kingdom in the world, all right?

83
00:05:13,863 --> 00:05:14,446
嘿!
Hey!

84
00:05:14,738 --> 00:05:15,863
我们不能搞事
We can't cause a scene.

85
00:05:16,529 --> 00:05:17,446
尘晶禁运令.
The embargo-

86
00:05:17,946 --> 00:05:19,613
尘晶禁运让我们日子过得很困难
the embargo's got us in a rough patch,

87
00:05:19,904 --> 00:05:21,529
但都会过去的 等着吧
but it'll blow over, you'll see.

88
00:05:21,779 --> 00:05:23,696
我们尝试帮助其它王国
We try and help the other kingdoms,

89
00:05:24,029 --> 00:05:25,196
这就是结果?
and this is what happens?

90
00:05:25,613 --> 00:05:26,863
要我说还不如让他们烂掉
I say let 'em rot!

91
00:05:28,071 --> 00:05:31,613
我道歉 我不是要故意冒犯你
I apologize. I didn't mean to insult you.

92
00:05:33,779 --> 00:05:36,946
你这种愚蠢的弗纳人肯定不懂...
Stupid Faunus like you wouldn't under-

93
00:05:43,738 --> 00:05:44,904
他活该
It was worth it.

94
00:05:49,988 --> 00:05:50,821
嘿 等等
Hey, wait!

95
00:05:51,238 --> 00:05:52,988
你们 刚才是...
You're- that was-

96
00:05:54,488 --> 00:05:55,904
我们会为您的安全竭尽全力
[Braodcast] We are here for your safety.

97
00:05:56,946 --> 00:05:58,571
感谢您的配合
Thank you for your cooperation.

98
00:06:04,488 --> 00:06:06,613
不要再搬重物了 听见了吗
And no more heavy lifting, you hear?

99
00:06:08,696 --> 00:06:11,363
好久不见 别来无恙啊 老友
Ah, it's good to see you again, old friend.

100
00:06:20,279 --> 00:06:22,321
啊 是的 是的
Ah, yes, yes.

101
00:06:23,613 --> 00:06:24,279
我们见过吗?
Have we met?

102
00:06:25,029 --> 00:06:26,404
好吧 这真是个梦幻开场
Well, this is off to a fantastic start.

103
00:06:26,738 --> 00:06:28,529
神经机械光学义眼
Cybernetic optical implants.

104
00:06:29,029 --> 00:06:29,779
你给它们做调整
You adjust them.

105
00:06:30,238 --> 00:06:31,529
大概每十年一次?
Every 10 years or so?

106
00:06:33,863 --> 00:06:34,738
玛丽亚!
Maria!

107
00:06:34,904 --> 00:06:37,488
对啊 戴着神经机械光学义眼的那位!
Yes, with the cybernetic optical implants!

108
00:06:37,904 --> 00:06:40,113
我大概每十年调整一次
I adjust them every 10 years or so.

109
00:06:40,613 --> 00:06:44,279
噢 已经过了这么久吗?
Oh wow, has it been that long already?

110
00:06:44,529 --> 00:06:48,279
对啊 我越老越有韵味嘛
Ah, I know. I age like a fine wine.

111
00:06:48,696 --> 00:06:51,863
如果没碰到这些笨蛋的话 我会到得再早些
Would've been here sooner if I hadn't run into these jokers.

112
00:06:52,446 --> 00:06:54,696
那时 他们要和某只小怪兽战斗
At the time, I thought they might need my guidance

113
00:06:54,904 --> 00:06:56,738
我觉得我得指点一下
while fighting a little old sphinx.

114
00:06:56,904 --> 00:06:58,363
噢 是吗
Oh, did they?

115
00:06:58,821 --> 00:06:59,779
不不不
No, no.

116
00:07:00,696 --> 00:07:03,238
他们遇到的问题远比这复杂
They had much more complicated issues.

117
00:07:05,279 --> 00:07:06,654
请问这位是
And this is?

118
00:07:07,654 --> 00:07:09,279
真是没耐心
So impatient.

119
00:07:09,738 --> 00:07:11,613
我觉得我没必要介绍
I didn't think I'd need to introduce

120
00:07:11,696 --> 00:07:14,071
擎天的最强大脑之一啊
one of Atlas' finest minds.

121
00:07:14,446 --> 00:07:16,779
在这样的地方工作?
Working in a place like this?

122
00:07:18,988 --> 00:07:20,946
他喜欢保持 低调
He likes to keep a low profile.

123
00:07:21,279 --> 00:07:25,113
而我最近则意识到 你们对这个词毫无概念
Something I've come to realize none of you know anything about.

124
00:07:25,404 --> 00:07:26,988
你们可以叫我彼得罗
You can call me Pietro.

125
00:07:27,321 --> 00:07:29,029
同时也是个热心人
Finest heart, too.

126
00:07:29,363 --> 00:07:31,988
他是这家药房的义工
This pharmacy is just where he volunteers

127
00:07:32,071 --> 00:07:35,571
不和埃隆伍德一起建设擎天那个云里雾里的美好未来的时候
when he's not building the future of Atlas alongside Ironwood,

128
00:07:35,696 --> 00:07:36,821
他就会来这里
up in the clouds.

129
00:07:37,029 --> 00:07:38,529
啊 上面太闷了
Oh, it's stuffy up there.

130
00:07:38,779 --> 00:07:42,113
在下面我可以帮助当地人 也很有趣
Down here I get to help the locals and have a little fun.

131
00:07:42,446 --> 00:07:45,613
我最近正在做一双穿上以后能让你跳舞的鞋子
I'm currently working on shoes that make you dance.

132
00:07:46,363 --> 00:07:47,363
你们有谁想试试吗?
You wanna try 'em on?

133
00:07:48,196 --> 00:07:49,196
有!
Yes!

134
00:07:49,988 --> 00:07:51,821
在试穿新鞋之前
Before we get to that,

135
00:07:51,946 --> 00:07:54,029
您不能帮我们一个忙?
we were wondering if you could help us?

136
00:07:54,071 --> 00:07:56,613
我们到擎天是为了和埃隆伍德将军谈话的
We came to Atlas hoping to talk with General Ironwood,

137
00:07:56,696 --> 00:07:57,654
不过 嗯.
but, um....

138
00:07:57,696 --> 00:07:59,904
这里到底发生了什么?
What exactly has been happening here?

139
00:08:03,071 --> 00:08:06,863
好吧 信标陨落时 没有人能独善其身
Well, the fall of Beacon took a toll on all of us.

140
00:08:06,904 --> 00:08:08,821
詹姆斯也一样
James was no different.

141
00:08:08,863 --> 00:08:11,529
我没法告诉你他在那里
I couldn't tell you exactly what it was

142
00:08:11,571 --> 00:08:12,571
看到了什么
he saw there,

143
00:08:13,154 --> 00:08:14,654
但那些东西改变了他
but it changed him.

144
00:08:15,029 --> 00:08:15,904
他
He's...

145
00:08:15,946 --> 00:08:17,279
他被吓到了
He's scared.

146
00:08:17,321 --> 00:08:20,154
偏执这个词可能更合适
Paranoid would be the more appropriate term.

147
00:08:20,738 --> 00:08:24,196
你得理解 不光是因为戮兽
You have to understand, it wasn't just the Grimm.

148
00:08:24,488 --> 00:08:27,988
有人完全破解了擎天的安全码
Someone completely dismantled Atlas security code.

149
00:08:28,279 --> 00:08:29,863
让它变成手中玩物
Made it their play-thing.

150
00:08:30,238 --> 00:08:35,196
并让我们在一些人看来像叛徒 在其他人看来像丑角
And made us look like traitors to some and buffoons to everyone else.

151
00:08:35,821 --> 00:08:37,863
能做到这种事的
Whoever managed to do that

152
00:08:38,113 --> 00:08:41,529
要么是天才 抑或是我们自己人
is either a genius or one of our own.

153
00:08:42,071 --> 00:08:44,321
我想答案可能是两者的结合
I fear the answer may be both.

154
00:08:44,863 --> 00:08:46,613
将军也那么想
And so does the General.

155
00:08:49,279 --> 00:08:51,863
也许擎天不是我们想象的那么安全
Maybe Atlas isn't as safe as we thought.

156
00:08:53,279 --> 00:08:54,946
我们跋山涉水来到这里
After we came all this way,

157
00:08:55,321 --> 00:08:56,904
不能就这么离开 对吧?
we can't just leave, can we?

158
00:08:57,196 --> 00:08:59,154
那议会怎么看待军队的行为?
How does the council feel about all of this?

159
00:08:59,363 --> 00:09:02,488
温特·雪倪呢?你有她的消息吗?
Or Winter Schnee? Do you know anything about her?

160
00:09:02,696 --> 00:09:06,279
议会都害怕到答应他的一切要求了
Well, the council's so scared, they'll agree to whatever he wants.

161
00:09:06,529 --> 00:09:09,238
尽管一些来自曼特的代表...
Though some representatives from Mantle...

162
00:09:09,904 --> 00:09:13,279
等等 你是Weiss Schnee!
Waityyou're Weiss Schnee!

163
00:09:14,988 --> 00:09:17,738
且慢 关于曼特 你想要说什么?
Wait, what was it that you were trying to say about Mantle?

164
00:09:19,279 --> 00:09:21,196
你给它刷漆了
You painted it.

165
00:09:22,404 --> 00:09:22,863
什么?
What?

166
00:09:23,446 --> 00:09:24,696
一切还好吗?
Is everything okay?

167
00:09:25,904 --> 00:09:28,071
你们是RWBY小队
You're Team RWBY.

168
00:09:29,821 --> 00:09:30,904
你认得我们?!
You know us?!

169
00:09:31,863 --> 00:09:33,904
亲爱的 我当然认得
Oh, my girl I do.

170
00:09:34,363 --> 00:09:35,821
我再清楚不过了
I most certainly do.

171
00:09:36,529 --> 00:09:40,863
我一开始还没认出你们 我真是太傻了
And I feel like such a dunce for not recognizing you sooner.

172
00:09:41,363 --> 00:09:43,529
我女儿和我说了很多你的事情。
My daughter's told me so much about you.

173
00:09:44,571 --> 00:09:46,404
你的... 女儿?
Your... daughter?

174
00:09:50,363 --> 00:09:51,529
有麻烦
Ah, trouble.

175
00:09:52,279 --> 00:09:52,904
等等
Wait!

176
00:10:11,946 --> 00:10:14,029
我猜这城防系统不咋地啊
I guess the city defenses aren't doing much.

177
00:10:14,196 --> 00:10:15,779
我真是一点都不惊
Somehow that doesn't surprise me.

178
00:10:26,696 --> 00:10:29,113
好了 我们不是大老远跑来扑街的!
Well, we didn't come this far to fail now!

179
00:10:43,363 --> 00:10:44,154
喂!
Hey!

180
00:12:17,529 --> 00:12:18,779
Penny!
Penny!

181
00:12:20,029 --> 00:12:23,654
亲爱的 不来向你的朋友们打个招呼吗?
Darling, why don't you say hello to your friends?

182
00:12:30,113 --> 00:12:31,238
向
Sal-

183
00:12:32,779 --> 00:12:34,196
你
U-

184
00:12:35,321 --> 00:12:37,738
致 意!
TATIONS!

185
00:12:49,821 --> 00:12:52,863
再次见到你们真是太开心了!
It is such a pleasure to see you all again!

186
00:12:53,071 --> 00:12:54,654
Penny 我
Penny, I-

187
00:12:55,071 --> 00:12:56,154
我以为你--
I thought you-

188
00:12:56,196 --> 00:12:57,279
挂了?
Died?

189
00:12:57,863 --> 00:12:59,571
我想可以这么说
I guess in a manner of speaking,

190
00:12:59,613 --> 00:13:00,571
她死过了
she did.

191
00:13:00,821 --> 00:13:02,863
但我们从阿米特竞技场回收了她的核心
But we were able to recover her core

192
00:13:02,904 --> 00:13:06,488
回到擎天后 我设法将其修复了
from Amity Arena once it had made its way/back to Atlas.

193
00:13:06,904 --> 00:13:08,654
费了我好些时间 但
It took me some time, but-

194
00:13:08,696 --> 00:13:10,071
我焕如新生!
I'm as good as new!

195
00:13:10,113 --> 00:13:11,113
甚至更好
Better even.

196
00:13:11,154 --> 00:13:14,113
而现在 我是城市的正式守护者了!
And now I'm the official protector of the city!

197
00:13:14,321 --> 00:13:15,654
不愧是我的孩子
That's-my girl.

198
00:13:15,863 --> 00:13:19,029
我们才不会让五马分尸这种小事阻止我们
We're not going to let a little ripping to shreds stop us,

199
00:13:19,071 --> 00:13:20,363
对吧
are we?

200
00:13:20,404 --> 00:13:21,821
当然不会!
No, sir!

201
00:13:22,988 --> 00:13:24,404
这真是
This is...

202
00:13:24,446 --> 00:13:26,029
出奇的美好啊
Strangely wholesome.

203
00:13:26,363 --> 00:13:27,821
听起来非常Penny
Sounds like Penny to me.

204
00:13:28,404 --> 00:13:30,613
我们还有好多事情要聊呢
We have so many things to catch up about.

205
00:13:30,654 --> 00:13:32,071
我都等不及了
I cannot wait.

206
00:13:34,029 --> 00:13:35,779
看来等不及也得等
It seems we will have to wait.

207
00:13:37,196 --> 00:13:38,154
我们等会再聊
Let's talk more later.

208
00:13:38,196 --> 00:13:39,738
我等不及要听你们的冒险-
I can't wait to hear about all your adventures-

209
00:13:39,779 --> 00:13:42,904
我为届时的体验感到非常兴奋!
I'm very excited for the whole experience!

210
00:13:44,363 --> 00:13:46,904
真不好说 我到底是完全了解了现状
I can't tell if I completely understand what's going on,

211
00:13:46,946 --> 00:13:49,363
还是有百万个问题没搞明白!
or have like, a million questions!

212
00:13:49,654 --> 00:13:52,738
幸好 我大概能回答一千个
And thankfully, I have about a thousand answers.

213
00:13:52,904 --> 00:13:55,238
但让我们先回屋里暖和吧
But let's get out of this weather first.

214
00:13:55,738 --> 00:13:59,279
我完全不认识那孩子欸
I have absolutely no idea who that child was.

215
00:13:59,321 --> 00:14:00,946
她很重要吗?
Is she important somehow?

216
00:14:01,238 --> 00:14:02,363
真是意想不到
That was unexpected.

217
00:14:02,404 --> 00:14:03,571
但从不乏味
Never a dull moment.

218
00:14:03,738 --> 00:14:05,363
但也不是不受欢迎
But I wouldn't say unwelcome.

219
00:14:05,779 --> 00:14:08,738
我本以为事情会变得更糟
I was honestly expecting things to go a lot rougher.

220
00:14:26,988 --> 00:14:28,279
干得漂亮 队员们
Good work, team.

221
00:14:28,321 --> 00:14:30,238
喂 怎么回事?
Hey! What's going on?

222
00:14:30,654 --> 00:14:31,613
嘿 同志
Hey, pal.

223
00:14:31,863 --> 00:14:35,196
我是个持证猎人 而且刚刚还救了大家
I'm a licensed Huntsman. Just helped save everyone?

224
00:14:51,029 --> 00:14:53,154
把他们装进下一趟运输车吧
Let's get them loaded into the next transport.

225
00:14:53,196 --> 00:14:55,988
拜托!我们只是想帮忙
Please! We were just trying to help.

226
00:14:56,029 --> 00:14:58,654
这都是怎么回事?
What is the meaning of this?

227
00:14:58,738 --> 00:15:01,404
这些王牌特工在曼特城里干什么?
What are the Ace-Ops even doing down here in Mantle?

228
00:15:01,446 --> 00:15:03,404
王牌特工?
Ace-Ops?

229
00:15:03,696 --> 00:15:05,363
很高兴见到你 博士
Doctor. Good to see you.

230
00:15:05,529 --> 00:15:07,988
我们接到报告说一艘未授权的飞船
Well, we heard a report of an unauthorized ship

231
00:15:08,029 --> 00:15:09,904
进行了未授权的着陆
making an unauthorized landing

232
00:15:09,946 --> 00:15:13,863
还有一些无证猎人未授权动武
followed by an unauthorized use of weapons by non-licensed Huntsmen.

233
00:15:14,779 --> 00:15:17,071
如果我们可以谈谈
If we could just talkthis out-

234
00:15:17,113 --> 00:15:19,779
被送上擎天之后 他们就可以谈谈了
They'll be able to talk this out once they get up to Atlas.

235
00:15:20,029 --> 00:15:20,863
出发(
Let's move out!

236
00:15:27,821 --> 00:15:29,363
你们看.
Now, this...

237
00:15:29,946 --> 00:15:33,738
这才像是我预想中的结局
This is much closer to what I was expecting.